  <item>
    <title>002：我带你春节回家，你居然觉得是去男同学家做作业！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ad187ca8f15b5c1cb900a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65ad187ca8f15b5c1cb900a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jan 2024 13:13:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎来到1993，这里是三师弟和空空春节的节前小闲聊，关于小情侣/小夫妻春节回家过年的那几档子事儿，</span></p><span></span><p><span>见父母买些啥？南北方的过年习俗差异？走亲戚时的尴尬问题怎么回答？</span></p><span></span><p><span>诸如此类的鸡毛小蒜皮，希望能给你的春节计划提供一点小参考</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们聊的很开心，也希望你听得开心~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 第一次回对方家里见父母是什么情形？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> 我拿你当准媳妇，你拿我当男同学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 给未来老丈人带的两瓶五粮液，差点喂了行李箱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 和老爸老妈一起玩UNO</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 如何准备长辈的见面礼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">23:55</a> I人的我，只要回了老家就成了e人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 亲戚问我一个月赚多少，我说肯定没你家小孩多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 春节回家你还会和许久不联络的老同学聚一聚吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一个夫妻档小节目，来自三师弟和空手接白刃lcm</span></p><span></span><p><span>【三师弟】：前资深广告文案狗，前户外领队，现于体制内混饭吃</span></p><span></span><p><span>【空手接白刃lcm】：97的ENTJ小红书绘画博主，想靠男人发财致富</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享我们的生活、旅行和自我成长的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>唠唠小家常，嗑嗑老CP。</span></p><span></span><p><span>生活也没多复杂，你来问来我来答。</span></p><span></span><p><span>茶米油盐酱醋茶，一样不少往家拿。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVneVPZ5eOQZz6C1jxJt636lYPF.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr_NNK2pDLOIYgbLz6PJkuljrNXI.m4a" length="34448878" type="audio/mp4"/>
